---
import BlankLayout from "../layouts/BlankLayout.astro";
---

<BlankLayout
  pageTitle="Privacy Policy"
  pageDescription="How Michael Watts handles personal information on this website."
>
  <article class="privacy-policy body">
    <h1 class="text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 4 November 2026</p>

    <p>
      This website is operated by Michael Watts. This policy explains how
      personal information is handled when you visit michaelwatts.me or get in
      touch.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">Contact enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      When you use the contact form, I receive your name, email address, and any
      company details or message you provide. I use this information to respond
      to your enquiry and discuss any work you request. The form uses Formspree
      to process submissions. Please avoid including sensitive personal
      information in your message.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">Website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This website uses Simple Analytics to understand how visitors use the
      site, such as which pages are visited and where traffic comes from. This
      helps me improve the website.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">Spam protection with Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>
    <p>
      This website uses Cloudflare Turnstile to help protect the contact form
      against spam and automated abuse. Cloudflare processes technical signals,
      including your IP address and browser information, to detect bots and
      improve its bot detection capabilities. For details, please read
      <a
        href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/turnstile-privacy-policy/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Cloudflare’s Turnstile Privacy Addendum (opens in a new tab)</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">How information is used and shared</h2>
    <p>
      I use enquiry information to communicate with you and take steps towards
      providing services you request. I have a legitimate interest in
      maintaining a secure website and understanding its use. Information is
      shared with the service providers needed to operate the website and handle
      enquiries, or where required by law. I do not sell your personal
      information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">Keeping your information</h2>
    <p>
      I keep enquiry information only for as long as needed to deal with your
      request, maintain relevant business records, and meet legal obligations.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">Your rights and contact</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on applicable data protection law, you may have rights to
      access, correct or delete your personal information, restrict or object to
      its use, or request a portable copy. To ask about this policy or exercise
      your rights, please <a href="/contact/">contact me</a>. You can also raise
      a concern with the UK Information Commissioner’s Office.
    </p>
  </article>
</BlankLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 48px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-block: 32px 16px;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
